---
globs: **/*.sh,**/*.bash,bin/**,scripts/**
alwaysApply: false
---
# Shell scripts (bash/sh)

- Prefer safe scripting patterns; avoid destructive actions unless explicitly requested and clearly guarded.
- Use strict mode when appropriate for new scripts: `set -euo pipefail` (and explain if compatibility is a concern).
- Quote variables; handle spaces in paths; prefer `$(...)` over backticks.
- Keep scripts idempotent when possible; emit actionable errors.
